    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633510/extras/692afe36d04e03fe6da0ee4b1e69d92a.poster.avif?t=1745250257\" width=550 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633510/extras/692afe36d04e03fe6da0ee4b1e69d92a.webm?t=1745250257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633510/extras/692afe36d04e03fe6da0ee4b1e69d92a.mp4?t=1745250257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Dive into a <strong>surreal </strong>world of horror, comedy, delicious dinners and <strong>time-twisting</strong> mysteries in <strong>Owl Observatory</strong>, a classic point-and-click adventure and prequel to cult-favorite <strong>Dinner with an Owl</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>Enter the enigmatic mansion of Mr. Virgil Brooks, a peculiar <strong>owlish</strong> gourmet who predicts the imminent end of time. <br>Play as <strong>Tycho Brahe</strong>, the famed astronomer with the golden nose, and unravel the <strong>dark secrets</strong> lurking within the mansion and its eccentric residents. <br><strong>Time is slipping away \u2014 or is it?</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Utilize your abilities wisely:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Travel through time</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Clone yourself</strong> for devious deception - But make sure that the clones never meet each other!<br></li><li> <strong>Hypnotize </strong>the vulnerable minds</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Immerse yourself with <strong>full </strong>professional <strong>voice acting</strong><br></li><li> Navigate a twisted, looping storyline<br></li><li> Be captivated by an <strong>eerie </strong>original <strong>soundtrack</strong><br></li><li> Reconnect with familiar faces from <strong>Dinner with 